#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186639432 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "22d9f658-2d46-512f-8497-a35109843d6f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{22}{9}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639424} {:answer/id #uuid "361bd596-db97-5d67-8621-949743fc548f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9}{11}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639427} {:answer/id #uuid "60151b34-66cb-5c7c-aaf4-85897cc6c175" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{9}{22}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639431} {:answer/id #uuid "d91bab67-6f97-5121-8baa-5eb76b2d641e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9}{22}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639445} {:answer/id #uuid "f85124d3-2271-5844-bee4-9ef7be4bcd73" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{22}{9}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639449}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "60151b34-66cb-5c7c-aaf4-85897cc6c175" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{9}{22}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639431} :answer-field/id #uuid "9d4594f0-856d-5e8e-9656-9f93e4a72a60" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639438}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "6116808f-1550-5222-8ea6-1d7753e86570" :question/problem "![](images/b1/b1ec0b7a502b5955006203395593b7cb23eef468f8651d49182fc59095ac5395.png)\n\nFor the parametric curve (shown above)\n\n$$\nx=\\frac{33 t^{2}}{2} - 11 t,\\qquad y=6 - 6 t^{2}\n$$\n\n$$\n-\\infty <t<\\infty ,\n$$\n\nfind the derivative $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ at the point $P$ on the curve where $t=3$. Give an exact answer." :question/worked-solution "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\nx'(t)=33 t - 11,\\qquad y'(t)=- 12 t\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{- 12 t}{33 t - 11}=- \\frac{12 t}{33 t - 11}\n$$\n\nAt the point where $t=3$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx}\\big|_{t=3}&=\\frac{- 12 \\left(3\\right)}{33 \\left(3\\right) - 11}\\\\&=\\frac{-36}{88}\\\\&=- \\frac{9}{22}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186639439 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08046c78-6f2a-573f-9bc4-9a765029924f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{35}{12}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639423}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "08046c78-6f2a-573f-9bc4-9a765029924f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{35}{12}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639423} :answer-field/id #uuid "62496c7c-8cf0-5905-81df-9db5d228c342" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639433}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "9e1fe9fe-6c29-5949-9877-cb0eb1fe911f" :question/problem "![](images/99/99b118406eb0c67ce3c2ca8508d2223402f2d78537f09b9dad20a4844c090474.png)\n\nFor the parametric curve (shown above)\n\n$$\nx=2 \\sqrt{3} \\cos{\\left(2 t \\right)},\\qquad y=- \\frac{35 \\sin{\\left(2 t \\right)}}{2}\n$$\n\n$$\n0\\le t<2\\pi ,\n$$\n\nfind the derivative $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ at the point $P$ on the curve where $t=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{dy}{dx}\\big|_{t=\\frac{\\pi}{6}}=\n$$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\nx'(t)=- 4 \\sqrt{3} \\sin{\\left(2 t \\right)},\\qquad y'(t)=- 35 \\cos{\\left(2 t \\right)}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{- 35 \\cos{\\left(2 t \\right)}}{- 4 \\sqrt{3} \\sin{\\left(2 t \\right)}}=\\frac{35 \\sqrt{3}}{12 \\tan{\\left(2 t \\right)}}\n$$\n\nAt the point where $t=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx}\\big|_{t=\\frac{\\pi}{6}}&=\\frac{- 35 \\cos{\\left(2 \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right) \\right)}}{- 4 \\sqrt{3} \\sin{\\left(2 \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right) \\right)}}\\\\&=\\frac{- \\frac{35}{2}}{-6}\\\\&=\\frac{35}{12}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186639442 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "77e62ee4-f6f5-5214-bfca-3db82f701f18" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{7 e}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639434} {:answer/id #uuid "8fabe51e-c6b0-56c7-9ddf-e173c3e6c3fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{7 e}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639435} {:answer/id #uuid "92960c37-67c7-5890-9c42-6790e55f2c60" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{2}{7 e}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639436} {:answer/id #uuid "b293b5d6-eb6e-5c21-8f48-68a20937a447" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7 e" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639441} {:answer/id #uuid "d85bab82-3d64-59b9-9539-f6012b9ffa7f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7 e}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639444}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "77e62ee4-f6f5-5214-bfca-3db82f701f18" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{7 e}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639434} :answer-field/id #uuid "55871236-bfdc-5bdf-9f78-3b30df198e24" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186639430}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "bd27709b-4772-5d27-a3ca-800fbfef4a8a" :question/problem "![](images/9b/9b1c9f6aa0dd5690ef3d2b83f235c5676b4e59ec728a23641632460d4b0f0a08.png)\n\nFor the parametric curve (shown above)\n\n$$\nx=7 t e^{t},\\qquad y=t^{2} + 2 t\n$$\n\n$$\n0\\le t<\\infty ,\n$$\n\nfind the derivative $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ at the point $P$ on the curve where $t=1$. Give an exact answer." :question/worked-solution "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\nx'(t)=7 t e^{t} + 7 e^{t},\\qquad y'(t)=2 t + 2\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{2 t + 2}{7 t e^{t} + 7 e^{t}}=\\frac{2 e^{- t}}{7}\n$$\n\nAt the point where $t=1$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx}\\big|_{t=1}&=\\frac{2 \\left(1\\right) + 2}{7 \\left(1\\right) e^{\\left(1\\right)} + 7 e^{\\left(1\\right)}}\\\\&=\\frac{4}{14 e}\\\\&=\\frac{2}{7 e}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186640208 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4e166240-b184-553b-8c70-f8e0c8183b61" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640211}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4e166240-b184-553b-8c70-f8e0c8183b61" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640211} :answer-field/id #uuid "46a5614a-2725-5853-8dce-81cb5301a8fe" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640210}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "1e1f24ed-ada0-5723-9894-ad728f4ffa3b" :question/problem "![](images/61/614dc0ba892aa7f2d74b32e97aa3363f521353c8ab631f809d2d54fee9127cb4.png)\n\nFor the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx=2 \\cos {t},\\,y=6 \\sin {2 t},\\,0\\le t<2\\pi,\n$$\n\nshown above, calculate the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at the point where $t=\\frac{7 \\pi}{6}.$ Do not round the answer.\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\nx'(t)=- 2 \\sin {t},\\,y'(t)=12 \\cos {2 t}.\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{\\left(12 \\cos {2 t}\\right)}{\\left(- 2 \\sin {t}\\right)} \\\\  & =- \\frac{6 \\cos {2 t}}{\\sin {t}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, when $t=\\frac{7 \\pi}{6},$ the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m=\\frac{dy}{dx}\\,{|}_{t=\\frac{7 \\pi}{6}} & =- \\frac{6 \\cos {2 \\left(\\frac{7 \\pi}{6}\\right)}}{\\sin {\\left(\\frac{7 \\pi}{6}\\right)}} \\\\  & =- \\frac{6 \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)}{\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)} \\\\  & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186640213 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9c718aea-2684-5b65-9e69-c288525ae6e0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640215}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9c718aea-2684-5b65-9e69-c288525ae6e0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640215} :answer-field/id #uuid "d6de867a-934e-55a2-985e-5b787b82d65f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640220}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "5f078f45-84d7-531f-aa93-7bab6561773e" :question/problem "![](images/6e/6ea91c863313b2a9fca67b8f4b2e38666d0fddbedbb974b396372777a7843e42.png)\n\nFor the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx=\\cos {t},\\,y=3 \\sin {3 t},\\,0\\le t<2\\pi,\n$$\n\nshown above, calculate the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at the point where $t=\\frac{11 \\pi}{6}.$ Do not round the answer.\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\nx'(t)=- \\sin {t},\\,y'(t)=9 \\cos {3 t}.\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{\\left(9 \\cos {3 t}\\right)}{\\left(- \\sin {t}\\right)} \\\\  & =- \\frac{9 \\cos {3 t}}{\\sin {t}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, when $t=\\frac{11 \\pi}{6},$ the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m=\\frac{dy}{dx}\\,{|}_{t=\\frac{11 \\pi}{6}} & =- \\frac{9 \\cos {3 \\left(\\frac{11 \\pi}{6}\\right)}}{\\sin {\\left(\\frac{11 \\pi}{6}\\right)}} \\\\  & =- \\frac{9 \\left(0\\right)}{\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)} \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186640214 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dcdcbb2f-10de-518f-a0b4-6dc6cb921d76" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640222}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dcdcbb2f-10de-518f-a0b4-6dc6cb921d76" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640222} :answer-field/id #uuid "19e685b8-8c7e-57f5-a828-efb7c63947c9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640207}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "99cdc85f-5c17-54e3-927e-dce60bec4508" :question/problem "![](images/d3/d367f75c6b66cb0e215770f4eb36f281487f470cb420e4fb7666422b80269f54.png)\n\nFor the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx=2 \\sin {t},\\,y=2 \\cos {t},\\,0\\le t<2\\pi,\n$$\n\nshown above, calculate the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at the point where $t=\\frac{7 \\pi}{4}.$ Do not round the answer.\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\nx'(t)=2 \\cos {t},\\,y'(t)=- 2 \\sin {t}.\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{\\left(- 2 \\sin {t}\\right)}{\\left(2 \\cos {t}\\right)} \\\\  & =- \\tan {t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, when $t=\\frac{7 \\pi}{4},$ the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m=\\frac{dy}{dx}\\,{|}_{t=\\frac{7 \\pi}{4}} & =- \\tan {\\left(\\frac{7 \\pi}{4}\\right)} \\\\  & =- \\left(-1\\right) \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186640218 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cd7086d3-7cca-59f5-8185-fe546d0ec046" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640217}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cd7086d3-7cca-59f5-8185-fe546d0ec046" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640217} :answer-field/id #uuid "d772a4de-a535-50e4-8a88-5e4a7b0eb216" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640221}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "d05bd389-51c9-51fb-9eb8-2ec312d5fff7" :question/problem "![](images/a2/a275e758044f59c6b6659d82749eeca15a9e120515d5a3b693957914ae3d42a2.png)\n\nFor the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx=4 \\sin {t},\\,y=2 \\cos {t},\\,0\\le t<2\\pi,\n$$\n\nshown above, calculate the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at the point where $t=\\frac{\\pi}{3}.$ Do not round the answer.\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\nx'(t)=4 \\cos {t},\\,y'(t)=- 2 \\sin {t}.\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{\\left(- 2 \\sin {t}\\right)}{\\left(4 \\cos {t}\\right)} \\\\  & =- \\frac{\\tan {t}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, when $t=\\frac{\\pi}{3},$ the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m=\\frac{dy}{dx}\\,{|}_{t=\\frac{\\pi}{3}} & =- \\frac{\\tan {\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)}}{2} \\\\  & =- \\frac{\\left(\\sqrt{3}\\right)}{2} \\\\  & =- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186640223 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0bb03e1b-7671-5d4e-b9eb-508fd3b59994" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640206} {:answer/id #uuid "37ef737f-bdb1-5347-bd82-82afde35df8b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640209} {:answer/id #uuid "579689d1-680b-5d8c-8b07-0b6448d30729" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640212} {:answer/id #uuid "d1676da5-46f5-5ea2-a93a-3d18c26f2b93" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640219} {:answer/id #uuid "f50b04dc-31f6-54ef-a30e-429eff6d0f30" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640224}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "579689d1-680b-5d8c-8b07-0b6448d30729" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640212} :answer-field/id #uuid "c066889d-132b-5b3b-9ddb-6f3a49a22475" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186640216}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f2668217-1781-5ffc-b121-cbeb86eeb3d5" :question/problem "![](images/7a/7ae65c873838ede4cce89c953ff2654fa1e58e65fdc87896c8ba85bbf947be20.png)\n\nFor the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx=6 \\cos {t},\\,y=2 \\sin {3 t},\\,0\\le t<2\\pi,\n$$\n\nshown above, calculate the slope of the tangent to the curve at the point where $t=\\frac{11 \\pi}{6}.$" :question/worked-solution "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\nx'(t)=- 6 \\sin {t},\\,y'(t)=6 \\cos {3 t}.\n$$\n\n \n\nSo we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{\\left(6 \\cos {3 t}\\right)}{\\left(- 6 \\sin {t}\\right)} \\\\  & =- \\frac{\\cos {3 t}}{\\sin {t}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, when $t=\\frac{11 \\pi}{6},$ the slope of the tangent to the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =- \\frac{\\cos {3 \\left(\\frac{11 \\pi}{6}\\right)}}{\\sin {\\left(\\frac{11 \\pi}{6}\\right)}} \\\\  & =- \\frac{\\left(0\\right)}{\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)} \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186641752 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3a4e8a79-ac67-54a0-adfd-6a73ada000d1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\sec \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186641750} {:answer/id #uuid "6f698a3a-f514-5d42-baef-2809d2e52e03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\cos \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186641758} {:answer/id #uuid "b319a218-d5ac-546f-8cf8-4398114feea2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\csc \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186641768} {:answer/id #uuid "b7df5a56-7f95-536e-add2-a88fd2b00db6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\tan \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186641771} {:answer/id #uuid "cb5088fd-4f80-5230-b8cc-644a1c0780fc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\sin \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186641775}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b7df5a56-7f95-536e-add2-a88fd2b00db6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\tan \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186641771} :answer-field/id #uuid "73397be2-e8a8-5a2c-8b2e-77a21d474f9c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186641760}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "56e98f59-5803-5c67-a234-5f602f006c68" :question/problem "Simplify the trigonometric expression $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{6\\,\\sin^{5} \\theta\\,\\cos^{2} \\theta+6\\,\\sin^{3} \\theta\\,\\cos^{4} \\theta}{\\sin^{2} \\theta\\,\\cos^{3} \\theta}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor the numerator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{6\\,\\sin^{5} \\theta\\,\\cos^{2} \\theta+6\\,\\sin^{3} \\theta\\,\\cos^{4} \\theta}{\\sin^{2} \\theta\\,\\cos^{3} \\theta} \\\\ &=\\frac{6\\,\\sin^{3} \\theta\\,\\cos^{2} \\theta\\,(\\sin^{2} \\theta+\\cos^{2} \\theta)}{\\sin^{2} \\theta\\,\\cos^{3} \\theta}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we use the Pythagorean identity to rewrite the expression in the parentheses, and then we simplify the resulting expression as much as possible.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{6\\,\\sin^{3} \\theta\\,\\cos^{2} \\theta\\,(\\sin^{2} \\theta+\\cos^{2} \\theta)}{\\sin^{2} \\theta\\,\\cos^{3} \\theta} \\\\ &=\\frac{6\\,\\sin^{3} \\theta\\,\\cos^{2} \\theta\\cdot 1}{\\sin^{2} \\theta\\,\\cos^{3} \\theta} \\\\ &=\\frac{6\\,\\sin^{3} \\theta\\,\\cos^{2} \\theta}{\\sin^{2} \\theta\\,\\cos^{3} \\theta} \\\\ &=\\frac{6\\,\\cancel{\\sin^{2} \\theta\\,\\cos^{2} \\theta}\\,\\sin \\theta}{\\cancel{\\sin^{2} \\theta\\,\\cos^{2} \\theta}\\,\\cos \\theta} \\\\ &=\\frac{6\\,\\sin \\theta}{\\cos \\theta} \\\\ &=6\\,\\tan \\theta\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{6\\,\\sin^{5} \\theta\\,\\cos^{2} \\theta+6\\,\\sin^{3} \\theta\\,\\cos^{4} \\theta}{\\sin^{2} \\theta\\,\\cos^{3} \\theta} \\\\ &=6\\,\\tan \\theta\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186641765 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e07ec80-c4ad-5de7-819b-c30c05795488" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\tan \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186641746} {:answer/id #uuid "22f4ad3d-9980-5759-b345-f8e6052735ae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\cos \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186641747} {:answer/id #uuid "621f48d1-992c-5e19-8c0f-480668c317bf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\cot \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186641753} {:answer/id #uuid "c651bb03-ae31-5fca-9ad0-ed294b24fc1b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\sin \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186641772} {:answer/id #uuid "c7d682de-551d-52e7-a1c3-35861b01f926" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\csc \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186641773}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1e07ec80-c4ad-5de7-819b-c30c05795488" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\,\\tan \\theta" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186641746} :answer-field/id #uuid "64e69e56-7205-58e8-94a0-c6c461e1d878" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186641754}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uu